# /srv/cell-ai-voicebot/env/asterisk.env (chmod 600) — read by the asterisk container only (ADR 0050).
# Fill from the client's trunk details (docs/integrations/sip-trunk.md). Never commit real values.
SIP_HOST=
SIP_PORT=5060
# udp | tcp
SIP_TRANSPORT=udp
# ip (trunk matched by address) | register (username + password)
SIP_AUTH=ip
# Comma list of the trunk's signaling + media addresses
SIP_TRUNK_IPS=
SIP_CODECS=ulaw,alaw
# rfc4733 | info | inband | auto
SIP_DTMF=rfc4733
# This server's public address and private range (NAT), from the server audit
SIP_EXTERNAL_ADDRESS=
SIP_LOCAL_NET=
# Only for SIP_AUTH=register
SIP_USERNAME=
# SECRET — kabhi commit nahi
SIP_PASSWORD=
# OPTIONS ping to the trunk every N seconds (0 = off)
SIP_QUALIFY_SEC=60
ARI_USER=cav
# SECRET — kabhi commit nahi; at least 24 characters, same value as ARI_PASSWORD in backend.env
ARI_PASSWORD=
